---
import ExperienceItem from "./ExperienceItem.astro"
const EXPERIENCE = [
  {
    date: "September 2019 - Actually",
    title: "Web3 and Fullstack Developer ",
    company: "Evolution Systems B.V.",
    description:[
      `▫️ Developed a decentralized application for exchanging CSC tokens from the XRPL
        blockchain to other blockchains (XRP, ETH, BSC, SOLANA, AVAX) with an admin
        panel for statistics, transactions, bridge status, and users. Included a public API with an
        API gateway and a microservices system to handle each blockchain separately.`,
      `▫️ Built a PWA for exchanging, buying, and selling NFTs on various XRPL network
        marketplaces, with an admin back-office for transaction verification, process
        management, offers, and payments.`,
      `▫️ Created a P2P betting PWA on XRP Ledger and Solana integrated with a Telegram Bot
        and MiniApp, with an admin panel for payment verification, user transactions, and
        statistics.`,
      `▫️ Contributed to the development of a decentralized poker application and APIs for
        CasinoCoin using Xumm, along with an admin back-office for user and operational
        management.`,
      `▫️ Participated in a location-based tracking application for potentially infected and
        confirmed COVID-19 cases.`,
      `▫️ Developed an online roulette game interface (frontend and backend) for Cammegh.`,
      `▫️ Installed and maintained Linux server services.`,
      `▫️ Supported the development and maintenance of a desktop and mobile wallet for
        Casinocoin and Crazy8Token.`,
      `▫️ Built an internal project management library with an admin panel for user and
        transaction verification.`,
      `▫️ Developed a PWA using CasinoCoin blockchain to verify and store casino spins and
        bets in real-time on XRP Ledger (TrustTracker™).`,
      `▫️ Provided software development, research, support, bug fixing, and API documentation
        using Swagger.`,
    ]
    // link: "",
  }
]
---

<ol class="relative mt-16">
  {
    EXPERIENCE.map((experience) => (
      <li class="">
        <ExperienceItem {...experience} />
      </li>
    ))
  }
</ol>
